    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hi there! Oliver Gumthrow here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm looking for anyone and everyone capable enough to use a monitor and a mouse! If this sounds like you then you are 100% qualified to be our new expert tech person at Gumthrow Industries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This very important button needs to be clicked, and you'll be paid for it! That's right money in your pocket, and a secure and stable job! Earn pay raises, customize your workspace, and upgrade your work experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While clicking the button <strong>do not</strong> get distracted, if you take too long to click the button you'll be terminated and replaced immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a quick sign up, take your seat, hand on mouse and <strong>click the button!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754540/extras/77886c70360d359528800d35a636fe8d.avif?t=1750710899\" width=600 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
